    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "married",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I thought about tying the knot, once. But now, I'm happily married to the wind rustling in the leaves, and the frogs croaking under the silver moon.",
      "translation": "O svatbě jsem kdysi uvažoval. Teď jsem ale šťastně ženatý s větrem šumícím v listí a žábami kuňkajícími pod stříbrným měsícem.",
      "sourceSHA256": "064ce2997d1a7db67be3beb0bc8da5feb250f850001185d1b6061e91bf10144c",
      "translationSHA256": "3a74aca6e3b0522e436772931e9b50db776ffc7bf35ee307f62e2903e4393a56",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "GreenRain",
      "field": null,
      "source": "All these strange trees will be gone tomorrow... it's one of the mysteries of nature.",
      "translation": "Všechny ty podivné stromy budou zítra pryč... Je to jedna ze záhad přírody.",
      "sourceSHA256": "04f5dc39fe9b77ce1b465ec6e840c0a84567fd04ab4a63d1cc126a9cb4bbfeda",
      "translationSHA256": "3fec5073f2bde62efab79d6a6c25a716fb4c88ac31ffe7e8b053aa23b71335f5",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "GreenRainFinished",
      "field": null,
      "source": "How did the moss harvest go? Hehe... My bed is a lot softer now.",
      "translation": "Jak dopadla sklizeň mechu? Hehe... Mám teď mnohem měkčí postel.",
      "sourceSHA256": "1d4b5c9a8158346a1ab845e65d17f990e34e2312b8efb414e0f0d9aeadbb6c28",
      "translationSHA256": "074cca98b70b02296f8f1ee37f29b1edea578508e7d62ff551c39b8fbdd21fcb",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "GreenRain_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I've already gathered enough moss for the entire year. How about you?",
      "translation": "Už jsem nasbíral dost mechu na celý rok. A co ty?",
      "sourceSHA256": "68c00d60d89c87abebb113e6aec1da451767bb9d16cdf754102602ddf440fcb9",
      "translationSHA256": "0d97548df1d89b7d8060d78f2dbe65bbe23514b760bee6b099c446fd51e1c917",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)774",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Let me see... it looks perfect. You're a good student, @.$h",
      "translation": "Podívám se... vypadá dokonale. Učíš se dobře, @.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "b6370867824ccc6a60501c94fb0435ab220fc78f31a34c90e2c549123b280ef5",
      "translationSHA256": "2b48a55ee5d9640d18a4e19cbb5f63d0d00e36805e70426a28cb01393508fc00",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)166",
      "field": null,
      "source": "No, thank you. I have no desire for money... In fact, I think it's cursed. [166]",
      "translation": "Ne, děkuji. Po penězích netoužím... Vlastně si myslím, že jsou prokleté. [166]",
      "sourceSHA256": "b68c2186a9f87a04ec81071cea36209354582b87123a47795e7b1531bd26566b",
      "translationSHA256": "c99244ddb77ea6c26e6e9e5685ee3cd5b1f2407a4c6186cfbf842bc91d164020",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "AcceptGift_Positive_category_fish",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ah, that looks fresh. I'll be eating good tonight!$h",
      "translation": "Á, ta vypadá čerstvě. Dnes večer si pochutnám!$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "565bdd367f944e911f1bb268db22f0198bba8158f8d38b6bc4cce9aea1beb23c",
      "translationSHA256": "ed9bbf1f12f290c6f86195a2135287ad9845cc977d83e2e628b8c5f115006890",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
