    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "cc_Boulder",
      "field": null,
      "source": "My old friend, the glimmering boulder, has moved on. It may not seem like an important event, but to me it's a big change.#$b#I'm happy for the old rock to see more of the world, though.$h",
      "translation": "Můj starý přítel, Třpytivý balvan, se vydal dál. Možná to nevypadá jako důležitá událost, ale pro mě je to velká změna.#$b#Mám ale radost, že ten starý kámen uvidí větší kus světa.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "84153421303999e37164a0f466731c2e4d4311e8dbfd61007055a479d1dfa21d",
      "translationSHA256": "81a01e7a89abdde89e08e09d39f3e55ea7213650cdf3f054ac58e2e6d4f16447",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "mineArea_80",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Very few people have gone as deep into the mines as you have.",
      "translation": "Jen málokdo se v Dolech dostal tak hluboko jako ty.",
      "sourceSHA256": "933842c8f601ae74355399e43a966863f409a85ac06b3ae2e0b6eeef02c8db70",
      "translationSHA256": "7efda2d20bb9fc3bb47955e3ad358bdc461ca0213457c93a9867f50af648a219",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "eventSeen_8357109",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The water here comes from glaciers high up in the mountains.#$e#I traveled to the source once, just to pay my respects to the water.",
      "translation": "Zdejší voda pochází z ledovců vysoko v horách.#$e#Jednou jsem se vydal až k prameni, jen abych vodě vzdal úctu.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e57d6bb6368b658caf1b23a6edfe55939f25eaca2aa34b19e06167ebf6704cf3",
      "translationSHA256": "6a48c7e059b864ad02d817de337480327e798bb7dada03c6d675166a0b6edaf2",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "movieTheater",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Movie theater? Hmm... for me, the slow procession of nature is all the drama I need.",
      "translation": "Kino? Hmm... Mně jako veškeré drama stačí pozvolný koloběh přírody.",
      "sourceSHA256": "a984d81db46192edd496626c84625f4dcc6c054fc486112f667063cecd0d98ce",
      "translationSHA256": "a7429ae51f489b1ff2a356ac219f1bcb77063dc5f743edf65a40d216dbfb51ad",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "MovieInvitation",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh... me? I usually wouldn't, but... okay. It's nice of you to think about me.#$b#I'll head over there in a little while.",
      "translation": "Ach... já? Obvykle bych nešel, ale... dobře. Je od tebe milé, že na mě myslíš.#$b#Za chvíli tam vyrazím.",
      "sourceSHA256": "152c173af53c58c68066a9b79e0e6db8a0dc03b90e7c7deb7b53f653e6fa8394",
      "translationSHA256": "560d8ed4a3f643afdf2280987ef8adb9ba8dda9aa1aa9d84e1a261927e128fb7",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "DumpsterDiveComment",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Find anything good?$h",
      "translation": "Našlo se něco dobrého?$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "9a0458c61aaa8009f75bbdc5f01ce2069bc085d42e968b369c6aae2a19ccd816",
      "translationSHA256": "e0767765a5ae7dda0ecb827214873f8794658a34d8c982214da629db2616e5cb",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "Mon",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The crisp air of the wilderness is all I care to know.#$e#I live out here by choice.",
      "translation": "Stačí mi svěží vzduch divočiny.#$e#Žiji tu z vlastního rozhodnutí.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e7245175b82ccd6b09d285c5eeb66e7c9c44385dfa621f0bce0c804a56043852",
      "translationSHA256": "77b78c030d28b481298a7557d3a000f132f581c6029da36521fc4eb26fd8638c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "Tue",
      "field": null,
      "source": "...Have you come to ridicule me?#$e#I'm just minding my own business.",
      "translation": "... Chceš se mi vysmívat?#$e#Jen si hledím svého.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5a06caf97b0c59cc56e81ed5e3c2098b32d3144bb204383deb521d0bc1cdfc5c",
      "translationSHA256": "f464ccbcb95b42ca510425485f13d7281884ffe70c2de4f9263400486e4e629e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "Wed",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I don't know you well enough to trust you. Sorry.",
      "translation": "Neznám tě dost dobře na to, abych ti důvěřoval. Promiň.",
      "sourceSHA256": "032bc0109222bc0246af501f9570cda618ada517fdc6919dcc8dae114f08cfc7",
      "translationSHA256": "529f91a90c50fe0a020e6b431a1e51e4399ce48caf37b314336470bc114f78c3",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "Thu",
      "field": null,
      "source": "...Hmm? Do you want something from me?",
      "translation": "...Hmm? Něco ode mě potřebuješ?",
      "sourceSHA256": "679fc622fa9f8fedaaa09f79b94febe52546962621189e0f8320961f9576521c",
      "translationSHA256": "c2131200366931bc08fed1878192c843651a1ca65f9881562121065f4d7c3a63",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Please don't destroy my tent.#$e#It's happened before.$s",
      "translation": "Prosím, nenič mi stan.#$e#Už se to stalo.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "36f5456e86b284f422969bffb6c9be8e3b52384b7a69ef5bf7653f17180d19ee",
      "translationSHA256": "2460ef63c4076ebc9f073b913ae230a3c4659090b89b6e2a538be542aafe8c20",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm happy by myself, you know.#$e#I don't need new friends.",
      "translation": "O samotě jsem spokojený, víš.#$e#Nové přátele nepotřebuji.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5d1ca27f6edbcec4a19e4dfc5d156cadca16d413f210a626a8082d79a5590f04",
      "translationSHA256": "b61fd899cad785dfc6370006afd4e68913edfce08ea91829f84a32dc22f25532",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "Sun4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It would be nice if the townspeople could accept me for who I am.$s#$b#I like living out here in the open air. That's what they don't understand.",
      "translation": "Bylo by hezké, kdyby mě obyvatelé města přijali takového, jaký jsem.$s#$b#Rád žiji tady venku pod širým nebem. Právě to nechápou.",
      "sourceSHA256": "2063651b869515f00fe13d7b58ec45a6405178ec7e250a4803f55aafbd2bc224",
      "translationSHA256": "e3a26cb097a7e2d3bfc21d4dc1debb9feaf5340bad51a92ff1238946fcc5f952",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "Tue4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You can learn to survive in the wild. I have.#$e#I think we all have a hidden urge to return to nature. It's just a little scary to make the leap.",
      "translation": "V divočině se můžeš naučit přežít. Mně se to podařilo.#$e#Myslím, že všichni v sobě máme skryté nutkání vrátit se k přírodě. Jen je trochu děsivé se k tomu odhodlat.",
      "sourceSHA256": "dcf85c44dd9bcb8a0df8e0dbd57df031f80c10eef33416e09c756bb0bd867a9c",
      "translationSHA256": "344d5300a1ca0d1287b44211d5011149da5608309314f9e73df38a068ab76899",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Linus",
      "key": "Wed6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I spend a lot of time thinking.#$e#If you can fully understand the reasons behind your thoughts, you'll have reached a new level of being.",
      "translation": "Trávím spoustu času přemýšlením.#$e#Pokud dokážeš plně pochopit příčiny svých myšlenek, dosáhneš nové úrovně bytí.",
      "sourceSHA256": "affe74f96db70c95265302d4c55584f1ce7d31e0d1187e60df5fc7dec97846c2",
      "translationSHA256": "f80de371c1831094fa9ed6d499145ff06273661f6defd59b46c3d5b0d8d9c632",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
